  "body": "Dreaming of a new home? Now is your chance to turn that dream into reality on this exceptional 516sqm level section, perfectly positioned to capture two-way views and surrounded by quality homes in one of Gulf Harbour's most sought-after locations in a quiet cul-de-sac.\r\n\r\nWake each day to breathtaking vistas where the horizon meets the sea, with spectacular sunrises and serene moonlit evenings creating a truly magical coastal ambience. This premium site offers the ideal canvas to design and build a home that reflects your lifestyle and vision.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Gulf Harbour, you'll enjoy easy access to pristine sandy beaches, charming cafes, and scenic coastal walkways. Families will value the close proximity to highly regarded schools including Gulf Harbour Primary and Wentworth Primary and College.\r\n\r\nJust moments from the prestigious Gulf Harbour Yacht Club, this address is perfect for those who appreciate coastal living and refined leisure. Commuting is effortless with the Gulf Harbour Ferry providing daily services to the CBD, and the upcoming Penlink Highway set to further enhance connectivity to Auckland.\r\n\r\nAll essential services are in place, including power, water, and wastewater, along with approved Watercare resource consent (subject to availability at time of build).\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare. Whether you're planning to build your forever home or secure a blue-chip investment in a luxury coastal enclave, this is a location that truly delivers.\r\n\r\nContact me today to secure this premium slice of paradise.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents, copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/VBG1",
